  "description": "At GTR Games, the newest corporate perk is a bonus for naming your office crush, and a massive jackpot for a mutual match! Overworked illustrator Seong-Eun has zero time for or interest in love. But when she checks the system, she's shocked to find three secret admirers. One is her childhood friend, U-Yeon. But who are the others? Could it be U-Yeon’s fierce rival, Tae-Eun, or the mysterious new hire? Is it possible that Seong-Eun’s longtime friendship with U-Yeon could develop into something more? You can’t rule anything out when the stakes are this high!\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
